   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Comparing changes",
     "texto": [
      "**Jo mer ..., jo ...** means «the more..., the more...»: **Jo mer vi gjenbruker, jo mindre avfall får vi** («The more we reuse, the less waste we get»). The first part starts with **jo mer** and the second with **jo**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Conceding and contrasting",
     "texto": [
      "**Selv om** introduces a difficulty; **likevel** presents an action that continues despite it. They show that a decision can have advantages and disadvantages."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
